Create antivirus server using the provided request body.

A sample request body would look like this:
```
{
  "port": 1222,
  "description": "server-1 description",
  "name": "server-1",
  "icapServiceName": "avscan",
  "address": {
    "ipv4": {
      "value": "10.23.12.21"
    }
  }
}
```

